abstract: >-
  A browser-only teaching demo (AI Teaching Demos): a browser-only teaching demo of Guandan, the popular two-deck partnership climbing game: level cards, the heart-level wild card, straight flushes, partner hand-over, tribute and return, and the A-level finish are all implemented. The JavaScript engine reproduces the Python engine move-by-move (including Python's set iteration order). AIs are rule-based (greedy / random), and a side panel shows which greedy rule fired at each step.
keywords:
